  "description": "This circular walk climbs to Moel Y Ci near Bethesda in the Snowdonia National Park. The area includes woodland trails, an ancient hut circle and the Ffarm Moelyci. The community owned farm includes 220 acres of SSSI heath-land mountaintop and Gwynedd\u2019s finest grasslands for finding fungi. There's also lots of wildlife and some superb views of the surrounding mountains and the coast from the high points.",
